Subject: [PATCH] AI_AB_TEST Economy: SettlersBeforeWonders and
 BookFinishesSettlers candidate flags (from the first logged King games:
 capital wonders and the book ending before its settlers)

SettlersBeforeWonders: no world wonder in the capital (neither the book's swap to the best wonder nor the normal choice) while the book is active and still has settlers to start. BookFinishesSettlers: the book stays active up to T100 Standard while a book settler is unstarted. Both out of the bundle. Adds CvPlayer::HasUnstartedBookSettlers and a shared lookup of the capital's book steps.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01G2NZj2nf4FeZTEHWjvnhhA
